你還跟我討論要如何行事,

738
00:39:25,250 --> 00:39:27,530
它有什麼本質限制,

739
00:39:27,530 --> 00:39:29,660
你講到最後一步不來,

740
00:39:29,660 --> 00:39:33,750
whether it is a good idea,

741
00:39:33,750 --> 00:39:38,720
and way it has been historically established by we the people,

742
00:39:38,720 --> 00:39:40,690
我們人民到底有沒有承認這個制度,

743
00:39:40,690 --> 00:39:42,690
we the people是美國憲法的用力,

744
00:39:42,690 --> 00:39:45,580
人民立憲的時候有沒有這個想法,

745
00:39:45,580 --> 00:39:50,990
where the institution of the judicial review is accepted as legitimate,

746
00:39:50,990 --> 00:39:55,580
the determination of its problematization,

747
00:39:55,580 --> 00:39:58,640
including the correct modes of interpretation and difference,

748
00:39:58,640 --> 00:40:06,020
is constrained by the value and considerations that have justified it in the first place.

749
00:40:06,020 --> 00:40:09,110
好,這幾個地方要稍微注意一下,

750
00:40:09,110 --> 00:40:11,070
等一下你會看到了,

751
00:40:11,070 --> 00:40:13,430
它講了一些根本,根本是什麼?

752
00:40:13,430 --> 00:40:15,590
就是價值還有考慮,

753
