外面也好,

760
00:40:29,910 --> 00:40:36,550
到底有沒有使得違線審查成為正當的這種價值和考慮?

761
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:38,220
that is,

762
00:40:38,220 --> 00:40:39,180
也就是說,

763
00:40:39,180 --> 00:40:43,490
by the answer given to the more abstract,

764
00:40:43,490 --> 00:40:46,490
the normative and speculative question of legitimacy.

765
00:40:46,490 --> 00:40:49,130
好了,中間調波,

766
00:40:49,130 --> 00:40:51,290
it is therefore important to determine,

767
00:40:51,290 --> 00:40:53,730
很重要的要決定,

768
00:40:53,730 --> 00:41:03,400
whether judicial review of democratically enacted legislation can be made morally permissible and principle.

769
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:05,720
剛才講的是legitimacy,

770
